{"id":"94b5a40ac9e27f34","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-anf.md","title":"Algebraic normal form over GF(2)","display":"df-anf — Algebraic normal form over GF(2)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-anf","aliases":["27-df-anf"],"display":"df-anf — Algebraic normal form over GF(2)","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]","[[27-df-boolop]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.12.1 Theorem 1.33, coefficient inversion derived in note","source_printed_pages":"44–45","source_pdf_pages":"68–69","verification_status":"source-representation-checked-coefficient-formula-derived"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-anf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-anf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-anf — Algebraic normal form over GF(2)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.12.1 Theorem 1.33, coefficient inversion derived in note"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"44–45"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"68–69"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-representation-checked-coefficient-formula-derived"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(\\chi_A\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span> 是下节对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq[n]\">\\(A\\subseteq[n]\\)</span> 构造的特征向量。</p>\n<p>定义目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ANF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{ANF}_n\\)</span> 是把系数表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathcal P([n])}\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathcal P([n])}\\)</span> 送到布尔函数的映射符号，其构造由下式给出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in[n]\\setminus A\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in[n]\\setminus A\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_f(S)\\coloneqq\\bigoplus_{A\\subseteq S}f(\\chi_A),\\qquad\\bigoplus_{A\\in\\emptyset}f(\\chi_A)\\coloneqq0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha_f(S)\\coloneqq\\bigoplus_{A\\subseteq S}f(\\chi_A),\\qquad\\bigoplus_{A\\in\\emptyset}f(\\chi_A)\\coloneqq0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ANF}_n(c)(x)\\coloneqq\\bigoplus_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\left(c(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i\\right)\\quad\\left(c\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathcal P([n])},\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right),\\qquad\\prod_{i\\in\\emptyset}x_i\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ANF}_n(c)(x)\\coloneqq\\bigoplus_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\left(c(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i\\right)\\quad\\left(c\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathcal P([n])},\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right),\\qquad\\prod_{i\\in\\emptyset}x_i\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>系数由 GF(2) 上的子集反演内建；这里乘积是布尔位的普通乘法，求和是异或，不是第 13 章实系数多项式。空指标上的异或约定为 0。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\oplus$ 见 [[27-df-boolop]]，$\\chi_A\\in\\mathbb B^n$ 是下节对 $A\\subseteq[n]$ 构造的特征向量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ANF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathcal P([n])}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in[n]\\setminus A\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha_f(S)\\coloneqq\\bigoplus_{A\\subseteq S}f(\\chi_A),\\qquad\\bigoplus_{A\\in\\emptyset}f(\\chi_A)\\coloneqq0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ANF}_n(c)(x)\\coloneqq\\bigoplus_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\left(c(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i\\right)\\quad\\left(c\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathcal P([n])},\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right),\\qquad\\prod_{i\\in\\emptyset}x_i\\coloneqq1.","display":true}],"bytes":1693,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-anf|df-anf — Algebraic normal form over GF(2)]]"},{"id":"180efadb94f279cb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\alpha_f$、$\\mathrm{ANF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-anf]]。"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817","11de8465f2282555"]}